{
  "id": "induced-color",
  "term": "induced color",
  "definition": "Induced color is a color experience that is automatically brought about by another stimulus rather than by the color being physically present. In the packet’s context, it refers to colors evoked by sounds or musical timbres in sound-color synesthesia.",
